<title>UK: HORSE RACING-SWAIN WINS KING GEORGE.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-SWAIN WINS KING GEORGE.</headline>
<dateline>ASCOT, England 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swain, ridden by John Reid, won the group one King George VI and Queen Elizabeth Diamond Stakes run over one and a half miles (2.4 km) at Ascot on Saturday.</p>
